---
<section class="section">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="text-center">
            <h2 class="section-title">Why Choose a .ma Domain?</h2>
            <p class="section-subtitle mx-auto">Stand out in the Moroccan market with the official country code top-level domain.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="grid">
            <div class="card">
                <div class="icon-wrapper">
                    <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"></path></svg>
                </div>
                <h3>Local Trust</h3>
                <p>A .ma domain shows your business is firmly established in Morocco, instantly building credibility and trust with local customers.</p>
            </div>
            
            <div class="card">
                <div class="icon-wrapper">
                    <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="8"></circle><line x1="21" y1="21" x2="16.65" y2="16.65"></line><polyline points="11 8 11 11 14 14"></polyline></svg>
                </div>
                <h3>Better Local SEO</h3>
                <p>Search engines prioritize .ma domains for searches originating within Morocco, helping you rank higher for local queries.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="card">
                <div class="icon-wrapper">
                    <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="3" y="11" width="18" height="11" rx="2" ry="2"></rect><path d="M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v4"></path></svg>
                </div>
                <h3>Brand Protection</h3>
                <p>Register your trademark and prevent competitors from claiming your brand name in the Moroccan digital landscape.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<style>
    .text-center {
        text-align: center;
    }
    
    .mx-auto {
        margin-left: auto;
        margin-right: auto;
    }

    .grid {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr));
        gap: 2rem;
    }

    .icon-wrapper {
        width: 48px;
        height: 48px;
        background-color: rgba(81, 112, 255, 0.1);
        color: var(--color-primary);
        border-radius: 12px;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    }

    .card h3 {
        font-size: 1.25rem;
        font-weight: 600;
        margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    }

    .card p {
        color: var(--color-text-muted);
    }
</style>
